            "layoff"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "由於銷售下滑，公司宣布臨時解雇兩百名工廠員工。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "Several layoffs were avoided after the union agreed to a temporary wage cut.",
          "highlight": [
            "layoffs"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "在工會同意暫時減薪之後，避免了幾波裁員。"
          }
        },
        {
          "en": "She was called back to work after a six-month layoff at the auto plant.",
          "highlight": [
            "layoff"
          ],
          "translations": {
            "zh-TW": "在汽車廠歷經六個月的停工期後，她被召回上班。"
          }
        }
      ],
      "synonyms": [
        "dismissal",
        "redundancy",
        "termination"
